    {0x005dc974u, 84u, "D_005DC974", "bound", "PROVEN renderer-context source and lossless queue-identity normalization. Matched rank-up blur caller passes .xpdata ab7560 (3x7u64/168B) to46f7e0; callback selects it and three typed getters read banks0/56/112. Both PS2 andGolden banks alias the same7queue identities in the same order, with identical8-byte slot remap. Normalize GoldenRVA family1e41b2c0+j*0x60 to existingguestqueue796520+j*0x30; all21emittedu32values equal existing84-byte PS2 table. No raw pointer truncation or newqueue object is needed.", "Source correspondence andqueue normalization complete. Implementertests must validate21pointer conversions,bankaliasing,remap identity andalllistedconsumer witnesses; no newrenderer queue namespace or prerequisite milestone is needed for thisspecifictable.", "image/l1/005dc974", "bound"},
    {0x005dcaf8u, 24u, "image/l1/005dcaf8", "pending-seam", "Structurally paired scheduler task producer/query/teardown establishes exact Golden NUL-terminated task name; zero tail outside live CString retained.", "docs/golden_mode/specs/re/l1-sequence-presentation-proof.json", "", "pending:M6c-2"},
    {0x005dcb28u, 24u, "image/l1/005dcb28", "pending-seam", "Typed source-file diagnostic field correspondence: complete PS2 basename is positively passed as file/line metadata in every enumerated use; unique full Golden source path with same filename identity is actually materialized asargument0 and passed to a known source-file sink. Full span/NUL/hash and all observed source uses are qualified in l1-diagnostic-source-proof.json. This does not prove unrelated gameplay function/table identities, runtime binding or active logging.", "Source-file field correspondence complete. Bind full qualified Golden path through all typed filename argument routes, inlines/translations/native copies, with actual release sink behavior; preserve PS2 mode.", "", "pending:M6c-2"},
    {0x005dcb98u, 24u, "image/l1/005dcb98", "pending-seam", "Structurally paired scheduler task producer/query/teardown establishes exact Golden NUL-terminated task name; zero tail outside live CString retained.", "docs/golden_mode/specs/re/l1-sequence-presentation-proof.json", "", "pending:M6c-2"},
    {0x005dcc64u, 4u, "D_005DCC64", "OPEN-retain", "No candidate was generated: M2 deliberately skipped objects smaller than 16 bytes; this is not evidence of Golden absence.", "Start with PS2 0x005dcc64 (4 B), consumer(s) func_00102780, sequenceRequest. Establish use-site operand meaning, access width and live span; then follow equivalent ordinary Steam .shared/Switch caller and record its literal/typed source. If numeric constant is compiled inline, compare the operation and branch condition, not global byte search. No runtime/BBV evidence exists yet.", "", "L1-open"},
    {0x005dcc68u, 4u, "D_005DCC68", "OPEN-retain", "No candidate was generated: M2 deliberately skipped objects smaller than 16 bytes; this is not evidence of Golden absence.", "Start with PS2 0x005dcc68 (4 B), consumer(s) func_00102780, sequenceRequest. Establish use-site operand meaning, access width and live span; then follow equivalent ordinary Steam .shared/Switch caller and record its literal/typed source. If numeric constant is compiled inline, compare the operation and branch condition, not global byte search. No runtime/BBV evidence exists yet.", "", "L1-open"},
    {0x005dcc6cu, 2404u, "D_005DCC6C", "pending-seam", "Typed sequence registry provider/getter/query-destroy-start dispatch establishes complete Golden22x96 descriptor bank replacing PS2 31x80; callable and ordinal normalization required.", "docs/golden_mode/specs/re/l1-sequence-presentation-proof.json", "", "pending:M6c-2"},
    {0x005dd680u, 32u, "image/l1/005dd680", "pending-seam", "PS2103f00 copies six signed32 blink durations, decrements the timer, toggles overlay phase, advances modulo6 and reloads duration. It is NOT a primitive-type/texture-index array. Golden2c42c0 does identical timer/phase/modulo6 transition at2c4754 with63a844. Steam43b7e0 constructs the actualsix values from a16-byte vector plus explicit2/80 immediates, indexes phase modulo6 and converts selected duration to float timer; its inlined draw-path43bf81 repeats construction. Both complete24-byte logical banks agree. Only8 trailing zero alignment bytes belong to the selected32-byte PS2 allocation.", "docs/golden_mode/specs/re/l1-c6c-font-native-render-proof.json", "", "pending:M10:steam-span-provider;pending:M6c-2"},
    {0x005dd6c0u, 28u, "image/l1/005dd6c0", "pending-seam", "PS2 104510 formats bustup/b%d_%d_%d.bin from three signed indices. NSO2c3ec0 stores the three signed indices in bustup work+4/+6/+8, formats this exact path at2c3f0c..2c3f2c with530a20, copies the resolved name to work+74 then chooses matching packed-ID metadata. Steam43c410 and43cff4 use same format. This proves the filename field, not bustup payload layout.", "docs/golden_mode/specs/re/l1-c6c-ui-resource-proof.json", "", "pending:M10:steam-span-provider;pending:M6c-2"},
    {0x005dd86cu, 4364u, "image/l1/005dd86c", "pending-seam", "99-level party HP/SP bank with4-byte prefix and4-byte tail outside physical object. Typed enclosing object, actual pointer loader and corresponding Golden source are qualified in l1-c5-typed-enclosing-banks-proof.json; runtime pending-seam, not behavior equivalence.", "Source qualified; GoldenM6b must implement and qualify every required_seam, including full bank, native/inlined readers and real producer/state lifecycle.", "", "pending:M10:steam-span-provider;pending:M6c-2"},
