    {0x005f0720u, 32u, "image/l1/005f0720", "pending-seam", "Both request field/script/dungeon.bf with flag0 only when the current step context exists and its script buffer is absent. On readiness, allocate an owned buffer from full request size, copy all file bytes, store pointer+size together, release the request and clear its transient handle. Golden merges request/copy into update states1 and10; fields widen and offsets differ.", "Source proof complete in l1-cohort-3A-dungeon-preload-proof.json; qualify every listed constructor/creation/finish/copy and native route before runtime closure.", "", "pending:M10:steam-span-provider;pending:M6c-2"},
    {0x005f0790u, 16u, "unnamed@0x005f0790", "D10c", "All4 original readers are positively paired with complete ordinary Steam/NSO NPC request/cache/install flows. Raw R5900 dataflow proves the CDV-directory local is copied but never read or passed to real I/O; independent filename buffers feed all real requests. The exact old source-file/line printf ABI is separately established, and those explicit output call sites do not exist in the paired native resource flows. Existing full day/night, fixed132B marker-table and indexedcomu.BF lifetimes are preserved. This is retired local-device preparation/source-location output, NOT absence of NPCs or all Golden logging and NOT a no-reference/module-label proof.", "Positive4-reader retirement/source proof in l1-cohort-3A1-npc-retirement-proof.json; qualify actual native request/provider replacement and every translated/native alias before runtime closure.", "", "non-supply"},
    {0x005f07c0u, 16u, "unnamed@0x005f07c0", "pending-seam", "Typed source-file diagnostic field correspondence: complete PS2 basename is positively passed as file/line metadata in every enumerated use; unique full Golden source path with same filename identity is actually materialized asargument0 and passed to a known source-file sink. Full span/NUL/hash and all observed source uses are qualified in l1-diagnostic-source-proof.json. This does not prove unrelated gameplay function/table identities, runtime binding or active logging.", "Source-file field correspondence complete. Bind full qualified Golden path through all typed filename argument routes, inlines/translations/native copies, with actual release sink behavior; preserve PS2 mode.", "", "pending:M6c-2"},
    {0x005f07d0u, 32u, "image/l1/005f07d0", "pending-seam", "Complete counted-row ownership/stride32/header32 and the request/install/derived-pointer graph identify this table filename family. The winter remap and night source are additions to the source contract, not a prefix-copy of the old full path.", "Source proof complete in l1-cohort-3-field-bank-proof.json; bind the complete recorded resource/initializer recipe and every required seam before runtime L1 closure.", "", "pending:M10:steam-span-provider;pending:M6c-2"},
    {0x005f0810u, 32u, "image/l1/005f0810", "pending-seam", "PS2 and Golden secondary loaders share null/poll/resource-source branches, an owned copied BF buffer with size, release behavior and frame-owned secondary pointer. Steam306810 independently selects normal/yoru by time5 and uses the same fd archive/member shape.", "Source proof complete in l1-cohort-3-field-bank-proof.json; bind the complete recorded resource/initializer recipe and every required seam before runtime L1 closure.", "", "pending:M10:steam-span-provider;pending:M6c-2"},
    {0x005f0830u, 32u, "image/l1/005f0830", "pending-seam", "PS2 request15cf70 hands to installer15d000; Golden1e6b80 merges request/install. Both own-copy the complete file, compute fileSize/0x84 records and count s16 -1 markers at stride0x84. The startup graph calls this installer after field BF and dungeon data.", "Source proof complete in l1-cohort-3-field-bank-proof.json; bind the complete recorded resource/initializer recipe and every required seam before runtime L1 closure.", "", "pending:M10:steam-span-provider;pending:M6c-2"},
    {0x005f0870u, 24u, "image/l1/005f0870", "OPEN-retain", "Actual dereference/typed field and corresponding Golden reader remain unproved. Retain OPEN; no-reference and inferred module names do not establish absence.", "Trace actual enclosing object and loader before selecting Golden module; qualify full logical field/index domain and source extent.", "", "PS2-retained"},
    {0x005f0aa0u, 32u, "image/l1/005f0aa0", "pending-seam", "The independently paired startup state machine loads model kind4/id2000, then field BF/dungeon/commonNPC/units, then the support BF. PS2 and Golden allocate an owned field-BF copy by the file length and keep its pointer and size together. Steam ordinary references2da461/2da634 corroborate the same three-path graph.", "Source proof complete in l1-cohort-3-field-bank-proof.json; bind the complete recorded resource/initializer recipe and every required seam before runtime L1 closure.", "", "pending:M10:steam-span-provider;pending:M6c-2"},
