    {0x0063ed80u, 48u, "D_0063ED80", "D10c", "PS22a6e30 called by2a5f00 copies exactly six f32XY points [(13,0),(0,13),(26,13),(0,0),(13,13),(26,0)], draws upper/lower untextured triangles and circle fans, and animates them with the old pulse/fade counters. Golden is positively a different widget representation: actual mcPanel state machine278ef0 requests memcard/p4g_savespr01.spr qualified by memcard/mcPanel.arc, adopts it through34be60 into work+4100 and binds a16-slot selection/count/input state (+3534/+3536). Main renderer279d30 uses that exact adopted SPR for upper glyphs1b/1a at x19,y234/245 plus native animation and lower glyphs25/26 at x19,y415/407, with endpoint predicates selected>=1 and selected<15. Native phase/counter state is+40e8/+40e4 with the actual0/3/5/8 clock and sin offsets, not the old six positions. Actual Steam mcPanel.arc was read and parsed in full: one1197600-byte SPR0 member, eight textures and47 parts, which includes all four real selected entry indices. This is positive replacement of old literal triangle geometry by the actual Golden SPR-encoded glyph/widget pipeline, not a claim that save navigation vanished.", "docs/golden_mode/specs/re/l1-c6c-final-owner-cutover-proof.json", "", "non-supply"},
