    {0x0063f3c8u, 24u, "unnamed@0x0063f3c8", "pending-seam", "PS22bdb50 allocates shop work, tags that allocation with y_fclShop.c and registers the owning shop;2bdf20 uses the same old file identity in its directory-load progress log. Actual registered Golden WEAPON SHOP producer278290 constructs the same owning shop through1b15d0: allocate170-byte weapon work, tag39d420 with this full fclWeapon.c path/line1966, priorityC6, callbacks1b28a0/1b28f0, draw1b2900, and construct its common shop base. The complete new resource-loader state machine198930 performs parent-qualified requests and BMD/BF/CTB/PLG adoption, not the old printf progress-log ABI. Thus the surviving constructor diagnostic field has this exact Golden value; the obsolete loader-log use is positively retired with the loader ABI, not routed to a second guessed filename. This admission is not a basename or module-label match.", "docs/golden_mode/specs/re/l1-c6c-facility-native-proof.json", "", "pending:M6c-2"},
