    {0x007144a8u, 16u, "unnamed@0x007144a8", "D10c", "PS24abd80/4abe80/4ac170/4ac640/4ac9a0 use effModel.c for failed owned-model lookup, allocation/source/kind and rebind checks. Golden361d70/362440 positively implement the same distinctive68/A4 payload constructors, optionalAMD resource validation38b790 and owned-model creation361bd0; latter scans type6 IDs then builds AMD and sets animation/reset behavior.361f50/362620 implement the same rebind, default animation, layerweight, reset/draw callbacks, visibility/option40000 and frame-range behavior, but without those old filename-bearing checks.361f50 explicitly skips missing source model rather than issuing the old assert; the shared initializer361b50 accepts an already-owned native model. The allocation source tag itself remains separately PROVEN at7144b8. Thus only this old repeated model-effect guard filename field is retired, not the model subsystem.", "docs/golden_mode/specs/re/l1-c6c-font-native-render-proof.json", "", "non-supply"},
    {0x007144b8u, 16u, "D_007144B8", "pending-seam", "PS24abe80/4ac640 use effMisc.h in the allocation source-file ABI before allocating9C/BC bytes, initialize tint -1 and transforms, copy source payload68/A4, optionally construct owned model, and for drawable set callback and valid frame range. Golden361d70/362440 allocateA8/C8 with the same exact68/A4 payload and corresponding model ownership; source descriptor resource+50 is validated by38b790 before361bd0 constructs model. Drawable362440 installs callback362bf0, flags visibility and model option40000, then checks signed start/end frame range. Both materialize include/effect/./effMisc.h in x0 at39d420 before allocation. Actual model ctor field and distinctive payload/callback/frame-range sequence establish correspondence. No claim is made that unrelated trail constructors have this include spelling.", "docs/golden_mode/specs/re/l1-c6c-code-audio-proof.json", "", "pending:M6c-2"},
