    {0x00761398u, 4u, "unnamed@0x00761398", "pending-seam", "PS2250ad0 flags6 branch draws rotating small glows with size42*.6=25.2, subtracting this selected scalar from both sparkle coordinates. Golden126820 is the corresponding full sparkle step: same flags6/4/8, four large/small glow passes, sin/RNG fade, period120, fade30 and random60..100 timer. Its base radius is32 rather than42; both rotating small-glow coordinate pairs explicitly add float -19.2 twice, then apply native pack offsets and issue sprite draw2e71b0 with scale.6, angle360*timer/120 and dimensions38/38. Exact embedded negative operand is c199999a, so native semantic radius is19.200000762939453, NOT25.2 or automatically doubled50.4.", "docs/golden_mode/specs/re/l1-c6c-font-native-render-proof.json", "", "pending:M6c-2"},
