    {0x007613d8u, 4u, "fGpffff82e8", "pending-seam", "Old1fb480 mdlEffectDrawScreenTexture scales the display-buffer rectangle around selected319.5/223.5 center literals and renders the display framebuffer with old640x448 geometry and normalized texture coordinates. Actual Golden4d230 calls4e180 repeatedly with the corresponding unity/zoom factors, variant-selected feedback color/alpha and blend mode after the paired encounter-flash state. Actual4e180 calls39e580, obtains its native raster object through33b590 and performs33b140/33b150 setup, derives scaled bounds around exact480.0/270.0 center in code4e1e8..4e20c, and uses full960x540 bounds when scale is zero. It supplies that raster to33eeb0/33ef60, writes four native24-byte vertices, uses960-wide/-540-height pixel UVs with the33b150-derived vertical origin and queues them through3938d0. The actual center has no old half-pixel subtraction. These are positively corresponding Golden code values480 and270, not guessed479.5/269.5, not the separate radial-flash center480/272, and not a mere resolution-ratio adjustment.", "docs/golden_mode/specs/re/l1-c6c-a1-fade-proof.json", "", "pending:M6c-2"},
